{"4560630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pantomime Horse Obstacle Course", "steam_appid": 4560630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/ddf4139ea806e395fe8ec986f47da1f7.poster.avif?t=1783521544\" width=762 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/ddf4139ea806e395fe8ec986f47da1f7.webm?t=1783521544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/ddf4139ea806e395fe8ec986f47da1f7.mp4?t=1783521544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s see some <strong><u>Horseplay</u></strong>! Welcome to Pantomime Horse Obstacle Course, a wacky, slapstick, couch-co-op platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PANTOMIME HORSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter stage left, the star of our pantomime… two halves; one horse; <strong>ALL</strong> Classic John. Stretch to your limit to navigate obstacles, or stick together and power through using willpower and teamwork. Featuring crazy ragdoll physics sure to make you laugh off every tumble and crash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/fb5ee40f8669126438aef48453c32da1.avif?t=1783521544\" width=940 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBSTACLE COURSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horse around and have a giggle, or work together to beat your best time in each Horse-some course and complete tricky challenges. Who knows where you will end up next, get out there and break a leg! (Or four)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/05ca1c9058693eb49a5962008fa4eaff.avif?t=1783521544\" width=940 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLAPSTICK CHAOS ENSUES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the show begin, try to keep up and go for <i>gold</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/7d998606cf4cf5c5466af71ba4ba8b83.poster.avif?t=1783521544\" width=734 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/7d998606cf4cf5c5466af71ba4ba8b83.webm?t=1783521544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/7d998606cf4cf5c5466af71ba4ba8b83.mp4?t=1783521544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/ddf4139ea806e395fe8ec986f47da1f7.poster.avif?t=1783521544\" width=762 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/ddf4139ea806e395fe8ec986f47da1f7.webm?t=1783521544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/ddf4139ea806e395fe8ec986f47da1f7.mp4?t=1783521544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s see some <strong><u>Horseplay</u></strong>! Welcome to Pantomime Horse Obstacle Course, a wacky, slapstick, couch-co-op platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PANTOMIME HORSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter stage left, the star of our pantomime… two halves; one horse; <strong>ALL</strong> Classic John. Stretch to your limit to navigate obstacles, or stick together and power through using willpower and teamwork. Featuring crazy ragdoll physics sure to make you laugh off every tumble and crash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/fb5ee40f8669126438aef48453c32da1.avif?t=1783521544\" width=940 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBSTACLE COURSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horse around and have a giggle, or work together to beat your best time in each Horse-some course and complete tricky challenges. Who knows where you will end up next, get out there and break a leg! (Or four)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/05ca1c9058693eb49a5962008fa4eaff.avif?t=1783521544\" width=940 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLAPSTICK CHAOS ENSUES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the show begin, try to keep up and go for <i>gold</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/7d998606cf4cf5c5466af71ba4ba8b83.poster.avif?t=1783521544\" width=734 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560630/extras/7d998606cf4cf5c5466af71ba4ba8b83.webm?t=1783521544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://share